      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] construct Zn(dobdc)(datz) with plentiful free hydroxyl and amino groups as hydrogen-bond-donor groups plus N-rich units → good catalytic activity and high TON/TOF under mild conditions"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] design porous MOFs containing hydrogen-bond-donor groups and N-rich units → promisingly expected to be efficient catalysts for CO2 chemical conversion"
