  "notable_quotes": [
    "High activity is attributed to synergistic HBD groups, Lewis acidic Zn centers, and NH2 groups that activate epoxides and promote CO2 fixation.",
    "Zn(dobdc)(datz)/Bu4NBr gave 98% propylene carbonate yield for CO2 cycloaddition under mild solvent-free conditions at 80 C and 1.5 MPa.",
    "The catalyst showed broad epoxide substrate versatility and was recycled for six runs with no decrease in catalytic performance."
